     "body": "<p>Based on the following documentation, this PR now uses the JBoss Transaction Manager:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://docs.jboss.org/author/display/MODE40/Getting+Started#GettingStarted-Usingatransactionmanager\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://docs.jboss.org/author/display/MODE40/Getting+Started#GettingStarted-Usingatransactionmanager</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/690\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/690</a></p>",
