  "description": "<p>This task is to establish a default Transaction Manager implementation to be wired into the ISPN layer. Currently, the dummy, in-memory Transaction Manager is used.</p>\n\n<p>Reference:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://infinispan.org/docs/6.0.x/user_guide/user_guide.html#_configuration_4\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://infinispan.org/docs/6.0.x/user_guide/user_guide.html#_configuration_4</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://docs.jboss.org/infinispan/6.0/apidocs/org/infinispan/transaction/lookup/JBossStandaloneJTAManagerLookup.html\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://docs.jboss.org/infinispan/6.0/apidocs/org/infinispan/transaction/lookup/JBossStandaloneJTAManagerLookup.html</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"http://narayana.io/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://narayana.io/</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
